flowchart TD
    START([response_start]) --> RT[response_subgraph]

    RT -->|direct / reject| FRD[final_response_build]
    RT -->|clarify| CL[clarify_response]
    RT -->|fallback| FB[fallback_answer]
    RT -->|normal answer| APB[answer_plan_build]

    APB --> AG[answer_generate]
    AG --> AV[answer_verify]

    AV -->|pass| FR[final_response_build]
    AV -->|rewrite| RW[rewrite]
    AV -->|fallback_answer| FB

    RW --> AG

    CL --> SUP[state_update_plan]
    FB --> SUP
    FRD --> SUP

    SUP --> PS[persist_session_state]
    PS --> EM[emit_response]
